    <briefdescription>
<para>Merton (1973) extension to the Black-Scholes stochastic process. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes the stochastic process for a stock or stock index paying a continuous dividend yield given by <formula id="328">\[ dS(t, S) = (r(t) - q(t) - \frac{\sigma(t, S)^2}{2}) dt + \sigma dW_t. \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
